er":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああこれでもよいかもだけど。\n\n`go get \u003chttp://github.com/foo/bar/v2@latest|github.com/foo/bar/v2@latest\u003e`\n\nこれだと \u003chttp://github.com/foo/bar/v2|github.com/foo/bar/v2\u003e がモジュールであることが自明なので直接いくんじゃなかろうか?","ts":"1614752530.144100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=2LW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ee211b9-841e-4930-b40d-7eff8d7fc1ac","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ほう、なるほど","ts":"1614752492.143300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2TzH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3236295-ad1e-4461-8502-95aba6dba969","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`go get \u003chttp://github.com/foo/bar/v2|github.com/foo/bar/v2\u003e` はそのパスがモジュールであることを確認するために `\u003chttp://github.com/foo/bar|github.com/foo/bar\u003e` を持ってくる気がします。","ts":"1614752472.142800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1614752485.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HZMU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43db37eb-744e-4abf-b552-d8c6f7ddb1db","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"@v2 は optional ですよね","ts":"1614752449.142500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jCz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82f552e3-4f73-41ae-94e6-f84537354fc2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"とるときは `go get \u003chttp://github.com/foo/bar/v2@v2|github.com/foo/bar/v2@v2\u003e` が正しい気がする。","ts":"1614752428.141900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qs2Zj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42c49440-2e8e-4b5f-9a68-040e70b78871","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"v2の癖に /v2 で終わってないモジュール名は弾かれるはず。","ts":"1614752410.141400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MY2sV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebd0b972-7f2e-4a9d-a5df-70e78a21f101","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`go get \u003chttp://github.com/foo/bar@v2|github.com/foo/bar@v2\u003e` はたぶんだめ。失敗する。","ts":"1614752382.140900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZGT9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"371f21d7-4124-4bb8-ae5d-1afc6067f4f2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ええ、そっちはどういう効果になるんでしょうね...","ts":"1614751855.140500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fta"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62c21654-955e-4db9-b014-bfcba46ac350","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`go get \u0026lt;package\u0026gt;[@\u0026lt;version\u0026gt;]`\nでバージョン番号指定しないでやるのを考えてました","ts":"1614751675.139400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F=q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d6a0ca5-e89f-496e-86df-5741e55ab0fc","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`go get` オンリーってことか","ts":"1614751647.138800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x4tmF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c8e53d5-4478-4c15-9f30-77ded48c4370","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; `go.mod` を書いてから `go get`  パッケージの指定はなし\nどういう意味でしょう?","ts":"1614751609.138400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BWXZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"973347ea-f9fa-47c0-ad20-0b70a3b83821","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/eihigh/items/9fe52804610a8c4b7e41\u003e\nを信じると\n1. `go.mod` を書いてから `go get`  パッケージの指定はなし\n2. `go get \u0026lt;pkg\u0026gt;@\u0026lt;version\u0026gt;` で入れる\nということなのでは...?と思いましたが、どうなのでしょう....","ts":"1614751274.137900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: Go1.16からの go get と go install について - Qiita","id":1,"title":"Go1.16からの go get と go install について - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/eihigh/items/9fe52804610a8c4b7e41","text":"この記事はGo Advent Calendar 2020 16日目の代打記事です。奇しくも16日目にGo1.16の話をすることになりました。 はじめに Go1.16では、Modulesに関する様々なアップデートが入ります。cf....","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-1.2.2\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-1.2.2%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3DGo1.16%25E3%2581%258B%25E3%2582%2589%25E3%2581%25AE%2520go%2520get%2520%25E3%2581%25A8%2520go%2520install%2520%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2581%25A4%25E3%2581%2584%25E3%2581%25A6%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D02f045b000969ed8642e3b06292ed9c1\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-1.2.2%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540eihigh%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3D75190a5ed39b22ef586ae15c6a990151\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=2f6f2040887c2a1eba8ab8e580b9d957","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/eihigh/items/9fe52804610a8c4b7e41","original_url":"https://qiita.com/eihigh/items/9fe52804610a8c4b7e41"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g0e2y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"453fd43f-b631-49b6-be4d-c6eb146ac37a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`go get \u003chttp://github.com/foo/bar/v2|github.com/foo/bar/v2\u003e` をやると v1 と v2 両方ソースとってくるように見える (go.mod には v2 だけ)","ts":"1614751094.136800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PB6Us"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be46dc08-1ca6-4605-a459-99dbf2cda1a0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://womenwhogo.org/\u003e\nwomen who go なんてあったのか","ts":"1614746103.136000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Women Who Go","id":1,"title":"Women Who Go","title_link":"https://womenwhogo.org/","text":"We are women of the Go (golang) community.","blocks":null,"service_name":"womenwhogo.org","service_icon":"https://womenwhogo.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://womenwhogo.org/","original_url":"https://womenwhogo.org/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"61oZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5465cbd8-9542-4430-a74d-190a96770810","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"れがび","ts":"1614744462.135600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tblld"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54d8295a-685c-4bc4-bd5a-0d78a0e47dc7","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"秘孔をついた感じだったので報告したらregabi案件だった。\n反応はやいなあ。\n\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/44732|https://github.com/golang/go/issues/44732\u003e","ts":"1614742526.135300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: cmd/compile: failed to build istio with internal compiler error: width not calculated: func() · Issue #44732 · golang/go","id":1,"title":"cmd/compile: failed to build istio with internal compiler error: width not calculated: func() · Issue #44732 · golang/go","title_link":"https://github.com/golang/go/issues/44732","text":"What version of Go are you using (go version)? $ go version go version devel +2b50ab2aee Tue Mar 2 06:38:07 2021 +0000 linux/amd64 Does this issue reproduce with the latest release? No, gotip only....","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4314092?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/golang/go/issues/44732","original_url":"https://github.com/golang/go/issues/44732"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hu50"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9524bd8d-120f-49c8-b1b6-149a5ea0943a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"譲渡なので owner switch な感じでしょうね。これからは tenntenn さん？が管理。","ts":"1614697334.133600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+YT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1179a22-7221-491e-b862-bd19d47119e3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なんとなく話は聞いていた。","ts":"1614697285.132600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lRRYZ"}]}]
